{
  "uid": "workshop-facilitator-control",
  "title": "Workshop Facilitator \u2014 path control",
  "description": "Toggle the Singapore hairpin from Grafana. Infinity actions POST /admin/hairpin; a private-probe agent applies routing. Do not import onto attendee stacks.",
